Afw-96CjwW5ntiNX0FuJDEOWTh-nOqi0SgcW_upHoc5vVA&oe=69BBE0F4"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "immersion_landscape_2560_1440_2.0.png", "id": "937521251404494", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39003279_937521254737827_2098704750444920084_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=k5iEdAcwhOkQ7kNvwF56RCS&_nc_oc=AdmnOwnavFtpKTlhEqr_BXZ_OqgL2gyERJPzqLg_rcyFDkYyi0jPGtR9z8vlRXJ_EPc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfyWsLygTG4ryFU7v5ZgNRG-5foMg9pDgRdHS3OCUC1drg&oe=69BC0CC4"}, "display_name": "immersionVR reader", "keywords": ["reading", "book", "immersion", "audiobook", "comic"], "long_description": "immersionVR reader 2.0 is a media reader designed for Virtual Reality.\n \n immersionVR reader allows you to read books, comic, graphic novels or even listen to an audiobook in one of many virtual environments.\n \n * Now with support for kindle azw3 and mobi, epub, text and pdf formatted books, cbr and cbz formatted comics or graphic novels and mp3 formatted audiobooks\n * Double page comic, PDF and Text book viewing as well as PDF resolution adjustments\n * New reading environments\n * Sortable graphical libraries of your content\n * New full support for controllers or gaze control\n * New music player for background audio\n * New hideable options\n * Popup table of contents and book images\n * Controls available to zoom, recline, change fonts, control audio and reading environments", "short_description": "immersionVR reader 2.0 is a media reader designed specifically for the world of Virtual Reality."}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "780624453996736", "locale": "zh_CN", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "immersionVR reader", "keywords": ["\u9605\u8bfb", "\u4e66", "\u6d78\u6ce1", "\u6709\u58f0\u8bfb\u7269", "\u6f2b\u753b"], "long_description": "\u6c89\u6d78\u5f0fVR\u9605\u8bfb\u56682.0\u662f\u4e13\u4e3a\u865a\u62df\u73b0\u5b9e\u8bbe\u8ba1\u7684\u5a92\u4f53\u9605\u8bfb\u5668\u3002\n\n\u6c89\u6d78\u5f0fVR\u9605\u8bfb\u5668\u5141\u8bb8\u60a8\u9605\u8bfb\u4e66\u7c4d\uff0c\u6f2b\u753b\uff0c\u56fe\u5f62\u5c0f\u8bf4\uff0c\u751a\u81f3\u542c\u6709\u58f0\u8bfb\u7269\u5728\u8bb8\u591a\u865a\u62df\u73af\u5883\u4e2d\u4e4b\u4e00\u3002\n\n\u2022 \u73b0\u5728\u652f\u6301kindle azw3\u548cmobi\uff0cepub\uff0c\u6587\u672c\u548cpdf\u683c\u5f0f\u7684\u4e66\u7c4d\uff0ccbr\u548ccbz\u683c\u5f0f\u7684\u6f2b\u753b\u6216\u56fe\u5f62\u5c0f\u8bf4\u548cmp3\u683c\u5f0f\u7684\u6709\u58f0\u8bfb\u7269\n\u2022 \u53cc\u9875\u6f2b\u753b\u3001PDF \u548c\u6587\u672c\u56fe\u4e66\u67e5\u770b\u4ee5\u53ca PDF \u5206\u8fa8\u7387\u8c03\u6574\n\u2022 \u65b0\u7684\u9605\u8bfb\u73af\u5883\n\u2022 \u5185\u5bb9\u7684\u53ef\u6392\u5e8f\u56fe\u5f62\u5e93\n\u2022 \u5bf9\u63a7\u5236\u5668\u6216\u6ce8\u89c6\u63a7\u5236\u7684\u65b0\u5b8c\u5168\u652f\u6301\n\u2022 \u7528\u4e8e\u80cc\u666f\u97f3\u9891\u7684\u65b0\u97f3\u4e50\u64ad\u653e\u5668\n\u2022 \u65b0\u7684\u53ef\u9690\u85cf\u9009\u9879\n\u2022 \u5f39\u51fa\u5185\u5bb9\u548c\u4e66\u7c4d\u56fe\u50cf\u8868\n\u2022 \u53ef\u7528\u4e8e\u7f29\u653e\u3001\u503e\u659c\u3001\u66f4\u6539\u5b57\u4f53\u3001\u63a7\u5236\u97f3\u9891\u548c\u9605\u8bfb\u73af\u5883\u7684\u63a7\u4ef6", "short_description": "immersionVR \u9605\u8bfb\u5668\u662f\u4e13\u4e3a\u865a\u62df\u73b0\u5b9e\u800c\u8bbe\u8ba1\u7684\u5a92\u4f53\u9605\u8bfb\u5668\u3002"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://immersion-vr-studio.jimdosite.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "immersionVR", "support_website_url": "https://immersion-vr-studio.jimdosite.com/faq", "website_url": "https://immersion-vr-studio.jimdosite.com/", "category": "APPS", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1043107547362485"}, {"id": "434961926215971"}, {"id": "3932224785